From: prismarine <prismarine@localhost>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:41:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] flutter_gpu, linux, windows (prismarine): the exports
 InternalFlutterGpu_*Mcsm* become InternalFlutterGpu_*Prismarine*, with the
 feature bits unchanged; Dart_PrismarineIdle and Dart_PrismarineOldSpace of
 the Dart patch vm-prismarine-names; PRISMARINE_RENDERER, with MCSM_RENDERER
 as a fallback, and PRISMARINE_VK_DUMP

