+  // Vulkan: 2D array and 3D textures (Texture_PrismarineInitializeLayered),
+  // the added pixel formats and 2x MSAA, storage buffers in render passes
+  // (RenderPass_PrismarineBindStorageBuffer), compute pipelines and passes
   // (ComputePipeline_*, ComputePass_*), and shader bundles with storage
   // resources and per-block uniform limits.
   //
   // mcsm10: 4096 = our renderer's needs on Metal and Vulkan: vertex stages
   // without inputs, storage and unsigned texel buffers in pixel stages,
   // more bindings per draw, leaf indirect draws
